# Placed by /ywr-harness:harness-init. Nested on purpose: the consuming repo's root .gitignore is
# its own file and the scaffold never edits it, but bytecode must not reach the diff. A Python script
# that stays in this directory writes bytecode when it runs. The CI gate treats a file no declared group
# claims as ungated and fails, so an untracked .pyc would fail every run.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
